# AMO credentials

`amo-credentials.local` (gitignored) must be the same JWT pair as on hostname **PC** (`~/proj/mybrowser/amo-credentials.local`).

If AMO rejects it: copy that file from PC. Do not generate a new key at the AMO API-key page. A new key here knocks PC / SLC / Surface off.

Mint a new key only if no machine still has a working copy, then copy that one file to every developer computer and every extension repo.

Policy: `mybrowser/docs/amo-credentials.md`.
